.idea/
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

# NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
!**/[Pp]ackages/repositories.config

# Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
coverage/
coverage.*
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

